WEBVTT

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.970
It's morning! It's morning!

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:23.700
It's morning! It's morning!

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.220
I know zakenna!

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.740
What a noisy bird zakenna!

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.790
The time to break the ominous spell has come.

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:55.310
It's too late for us to turn back now.

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:56.500
We can only move forward.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:59.800
No matter what you do, it will be useless...

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.050
I'm the only one who can draw out 
the power of the Prism Stones.

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:04.800
I'm the only one...!

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:07.340
That's right, Keeper...

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:09.210
It's your turn.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.090
What are you doing?

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:19.140
Stop it.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:26.110
You're the only one who can draw 
out the power of the stones...

00:01:26.630 --> 00:01:28.800
What are you going to do?

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.990
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:52.660
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:55.430
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:59.900
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:02.600
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:05.740
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:07.340
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:11.340
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.140
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:18.950
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:20.920
<i>we both</i>

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:22.250
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.820
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.830
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:31.400
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:34.570
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:37.140
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:43.310
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:44.610
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:47.080
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:50.110
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:54.390
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.460
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:01.190
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:06.690
Happy delicious! I'm going to eat this year, too... 
Nagisa

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.390
That Nagisa!

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:09.450
The third term is starting today.

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:13.830
I'm leaving!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:47.140
I feel like I got lots of encouragement 
from everyone in the Sakura class.

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.610
When I'm with everyone,

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:52.580
I really feel full of energy and courage...

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.330
It's where I belong...

00:03:55.650 --> 00:03:57.330
Where I can come home to.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.400
And I feel so secure.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.380
Nagisa! Happy New Year!

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:07.610
Happy New Year!

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:09.190
Best wishes for a Happy New Year!

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:10.830
Thanks for the New Year's card.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:14.270
Your New Year's card made me laugh, Nagisa.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:17.200
That's right. That was 
definitely a chicken (tori).

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:19.800
Didn't it look delicious?

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:20.670
Happy New Year!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.600
Honoka! Happy New Year!

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:23.820
Happy New Year!

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.310
Nagisa... Thank you for the 
delicious looking New Year's card.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.240
Wasn't it?

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:32.250
That's an unusual way to express the 
Year of the Rooster (tori), though.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.790
I'm a genius.

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:35.580
You are... You really are.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:36.980
You're a genius, Nagisa.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.600
The third term starts today...

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:43.730
I'm raring to go.

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:48.640
It's the last term of our second year...

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:50.330
Let's all do our best.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.690
Let's do our best.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:04.280
"IT'S THE PITS! HAS THE POWER 
OF THE STONES BEEN STOLEN?!"

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.150
No! Are you sure?

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:10.280
I'm sure! I saw it on the 
special New Year's program.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:12.960
Nagisa! Something's coming from behind mepo.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:14.360
Coming from behind?

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.030
Be careful mipo!

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:17.550
What is it?

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.870
Those three... At a time like this?

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:26.640
It can't be!

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:31.900
Hey! What's wrong? We'd better hurry, and go!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.320
It looks like they can't see them.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:39.620
That's true.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.730
They're different this time mepo!

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.660
Protect Pollun mipo!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:48.480
Nagisa!

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.750
I'm scared popo!

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:55.620
Hurry, Honoka!

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:12.520
It looks like we have no choice, doesn't it?

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.960
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.570
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:32.170
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.760
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.210
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:42.650
Go back to where you came from!

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.250
The time has finally come...

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:52.520
To do what we have to do.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.560
I don't know what's your 
rush, but if you think you'll

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.360
get what you want, then 
you're greatly mistaken.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.880
I wonder about that.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:12.940
What was that? That move...

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:14.910
...was really fast.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.980
Now is the time for us to 
get the power of the stones.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:19.820
White!

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.170
White!

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.230
Your opponent is right here!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:35.730
But it's not going to be like the last time.

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:41.910
Black!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.240
Hurry! Get them out of the way!

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:51.480
We don't have time to waste!

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.250
What is it? Why are you in such a hurry?

00:07:58.060 --> 00:07:58.560
Juna!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:02.530
I'm... okay!

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:04.140
It won't be long now...

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:07.500
We'll soon be able to escape our destiny.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.720
We won't let you do as you please!

00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:15.840
White!

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.070
That's enough!

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:25.450
Black!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:33.640
That's right...

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:36.050
It won't be long now...

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:41.410
The Power of Creation will soon be mine.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:47.290
And... I'll be complete.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:59.930
Oh, no! The Power of Creation 
is facing extreme danger, Queen.

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.220
The light is...

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:12.280
about to be swallowed by darkness.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.580
Something terrifying...

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:19.620
A terror like nothing before.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:28.350
We can't turn back now.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:34.190
We don't have time to be indecisive.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.820
We won't let you interfere.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.880
The end is here!

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.060
No popo!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:47.470
Pollun!

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:48.900
You mustn't come out, Pollun!

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.230
No popo!

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:57.140
Stop picking on Pretty Cula popo!

00:09:58.290 --> 00:09:58.840
Pollun!

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.450
That's what I've been waiting for!

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:04.510
Popo!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.400
I'm scared popo!

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:19.030
I got him!

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:21.470
Pollun!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.630
I finally got it!

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:30.970
The Power of Creation!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.540
Po... po...

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:58.270
Pollun!

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:00.750
We won't let you have Pollun.

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.690
Give him back!

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:04.240
Don't move!

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:06.410
Popo...!

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:09.150
Pollun!

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:11.070
Po... po...!

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:13.120
What are you going to do?

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.770
All you can do is stand there, and watch.

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.060
That's cowardly!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.570
Now it's your turn!

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:29.270
Stone Keeper?

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:38.210
Bringing Stone Keeper here... 
What's going on mepo?

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.510
What are you planning to do anyway mipo?

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:43.480
Don't tell me... The power 
of the seven stones...?

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:46.180
Po... Pollun!

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:48.450
Popo...

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:54.890
Don't worry! No one but me can 
draw out the power of the stones.

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:57.400
There's no way they could learn how.

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:03.370
Why do you think I captured you, and 
put you in the bird cage anyway?

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:11.040
Do you think I spent all 
that time together with

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:14.310
you in that room for nothing?

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:19.920
I absorbed your ability.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.890
That's ridiculous!

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:24.710
Getting though the scattered 
pieces of knowledge, where

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:29.860
the power was kept, and putting 
all the fragments together

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.670
into something that made 
sense took a lot of effort.

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:36.160
But I finally began to see something 
that resembled a magic spell.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.640
What are you planning to do?

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.340
This is bad mepo!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:44.260
If I were you, I would start off 
by saying something like this...

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:49.060
Power of Creation... Answer my plea...

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:52.750
Pollun!

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:54.750
This is terrible mipo!

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:56.830
Did I get it right?

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:00.630
Then next, I would say these words...

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:05.060
Together with the seven stones, 
separate yourself from the stones!

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:07.530
Don't say anymore!

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:12.340
It looks like I've got it right.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.480
No! Don't! Stop it!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:25.100
Then finally, you would 
end it with these words...

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.220
No! Stop!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:27.730
Don't say it! No!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:32.360
In the name of the keeper 
of the Prism Hopish,

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:36.160
power of the seven Prism Stones, 
go back to where you came from!

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:43.870
The power of the stones...!

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:46.000
We're done for now mipo!

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:01.000
No! The power of the seven stones...

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:10.700
Now we can finally escape from the spell.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:13.670
The power of the seven stones is...

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.560
...in our hands!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:17.980
We're going back!

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:19.370
Stop it!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:20.280
Wait!

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.230
Let me go!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.030
Don't! Stop it!

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:29.480
Stone Keeper!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.540
What are we going to do?

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:39.230
Popo!

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.070
Pollun!

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:42.510
I'm scared... I'm so scared popo!

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:43.630
Are you okay?

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:46.330
I'm scared popo!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:47.970
You're okay now.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.370
Pollun!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:53.040
They took the power of the seven stones.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:56.570
If we don't get Stone Keeper back, 
it's going to be disastrous.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.960
What's going to happen now mipo?

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.320
I don't know mepo.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.990
We don't know what's going to happen...

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.340
We don't know what to do.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.460
But...

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:27.780
I don't want to just give 
up without doing anything.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.140
You're right.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:32.690
We're the only ones who 
can do something about it.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:37.430
I really can't imagine what's waiting 
for us, but no matter what,

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:40.750
we're the only ones who can get it back.

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:42.120
You're right.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:43.870
We have no choice, do we?

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.190
Honoka...

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.160
Nagisa!

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:52.130
No matter what happens, it's 
you and me together, Nagisa.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:55.690
You're right! No matter what happens, 
we're in this together, aren't we?

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:58.520
I'm with you, too popo!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.100
Pollun?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.060
We're all together popo!

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:03.510
Pollun...!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.890
We're all going together popo!

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.170
We're all together mipo!

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:12.600
Wait! I'm going too mepo!

00:16:14.090 --> 00:16:15.060
All of you...?

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.260
We're not going to play.

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:30.040
This came out nice, didn't it?

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:31.760
This is great!

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.940
Nagisa! Look at this. Look at it.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:35.430
What is it?

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.810
It's from the singing competition.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:42.270
My dad took it.

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:45.780
You should see Nagisa's face in 
this one, it's something else.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.750
My face...?

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.620
What is this?

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.910
It can't be!

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:53.910
It's really funny, isn't it?

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:55.590
I don't remember looking like this.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:58.560
It's the way the photo was taken.

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.810
It's what's called the 
perfect shutter chance.

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:02.280
Photos are honest.

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:04.790
What about this photo of you, Shiho?

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:05.770
It's funny.

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:07.040
No! No! No!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:09.690
Didn't you say photos are honest?

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.860
The perfect shutter chance...?

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:13.450
No... you're wrong. That's not it.

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:15.090
That's what you said!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:17.450
But I can't show this photo...

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:18.450
Don't worry...

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.250
You look like this all the time, Shiho.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:22.470
Wait a minute! How rude!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.950
It's a photo of a memorable, fun time we 
had, so it doesn't matter, does it, Kyoko?

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:27.050
No! No! No!

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.430
It was fun, wasn't it?

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:33.040
Didn't you have a nice time, too, Shiho?

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:35.180
It was fun.

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:38.430
The song was the best.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:40.330
It was... It was the best!

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:12.760
Nagisa... What do you think will happen now?

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:21.090
We'll be able to go to school again 
like we always did, won't we?

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:25.680
Of course! It's just like 
going away on a short trip.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.790
It won't be long before everything 
goes back to the way it was,

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:31.790
and we'll be able to laugh and 
study with everyone again.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:32.650
You're right.

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:36.150
If we think of it like that, 
it's nothing, isn't it?

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:41.360
No matter what happens, 
we'll be together, won't we?

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:47.570
It's possible that that 
was the last time we'll

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.920
see everyone in our class smiling, isn't it?

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:53.540
It may turn out that way, but we have to go.

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:57.280
This time, we really don't 
know what's going to happen.

00:19:57.730 --> 00:19:59.260
I can't even imagine 
what's going to happen...

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:01.510
But we have to go.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:03.480
Nagisa!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:12.950
Wow! Look at how bright the seven 
stones are shining zakenna!

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:15.430
Never mind! Hurry, and carry it zakenna.

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:18.480
If we don't hurry, we'll 
get scolded again zakenna!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:20.440
What's going to happen zakenna?

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.390
Never mind! Just hurry zakenna!

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:25.110
Wow! It's awesome zakenna!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:25.700
Zakenna!

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:40.920
Zakenna!

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:52.250
The power of the stones...

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:00.910
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:30.270
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.870
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:36.640
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:40.010
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.450
Go back to where you came from!

00:22:00.470 --> 00:22:02.150
Ready, White?

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:05.550
We'll get it back for sure.

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:08.610
So we can see everyone's smile once again.

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.320
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:26.860
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:29.560
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.300
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:51.580
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.690
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:10.700
<i>I'm a teenager with a</i>

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>heart throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:16.670
<i>I don't want to lose that</i>

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.950
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>It's romance rather than stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:31.890
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:34.930
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>I'd rather cuddle than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:42.970
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:44.370
<i>So why am I</i>

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:45.970
<i>stuffing my face</i>

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:56.110
We have to get the power of the stones back.

00:23:56.110 --> 00:23:57.580
In order to do that, we have to go

00:23:57.580 --> 00:23:59.040
to Dotsuku Zone, the world of darkness.

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:00.980
I never wanted to go back there again.

00:24:00.980 --> 00:24:04.220
But I don't want Mepple, Mipple, 
Pollun and the others to be sad.

00:24:04.220 --> 00:24:05.520
Let's do our best!

00:24:06.330 --> 00:24:08.770
Wait a minute! Aren't they acting strangely?

00:24:08.770 --> 00:24:10.800
What in the world is happening?

00:24:11.690 --> 00:24:15.770
"THE MOST POWERFUL WARRIOR APPEARS! NO WAY!!"

00:24:16.030 --> 00:24:17.240
Is it okay if we...

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:18.610
...just go back to where we came from?

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:19.530
Hey!
